    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amaryllis is a cute exploration RPG about a sentient flower brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/803fc5483e9e39ecb841ff7aab657ea6.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/803fc5483e9e39ecb841ff7aab657ea6.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, build, craft, and explore to uncover your origins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/517c27e4ae65de549c00ea3a04340c2b.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/517c27e4ae65de549c00ea3a04340c2b.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode the local language\u00a0using your trusty digital magnifying glass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated into many different languages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/fa213e20a2a49be36c2afc972303ec9c.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/fa213e20a2a49be36c2afc972303ec9c.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedural dungeons and gather valuable resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/ad1c4b5630671f386cd216a8dee20c5c.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/ad1c4b5630671f386cd216a8dee20c5c.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play lots of minigames, like roguelike slots, pinball, and rhythm battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/03d2b846a9aa30f6e506cfc0035c068b.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/03d2b846a9aa30f6e506cfc0035c068b.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling, discovery, and boss battles in a strange, expressive world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/0cc7a27ab87dff2c95b8da0e62055cec.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/0cc7a27ab87dff2c95b8da0e62055cec.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/0cc7a27ab87dff2c95b8da0e62055cec.mp4?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amaryllis is a cute exploration RPG about a sentient flower brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/803fc5483e9e39ecb841ff7aab657ea6.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/803fc5483e9e39ecb841ff7aab657ea6.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, build, craft, and explore to uncover your origins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/517c27e4ae65de549c00ea3a04340c2b.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/517c27e4ae65de549c00ea3a04340c2b.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decode the local language\u00a0using your trusty digital magnifying glass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated into many different languages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/fa213e20a2a49be36c2afc972303ec9c.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/fa213e20a2a49be36c2afc972303ec9c.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedural dungeons and gather valuable resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/ad1c4b5630671f386cd216a8dee20c5c.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/ad1c4b5630671f386cd216a8dee20c5c.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play lots of minigames, like roguelike slots, pinball, and rhythm battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/03d2b846a9aa30f6e506cfc0035c068b.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/03d2b846a9aa30f6e506cfc0035c068b.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling, discovery, and boss battles in a strange, expressive world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/0cc7a27ab87dff2c95b8da0e62055cec.poster.avif?t=1749095926\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/0cc7a27ab87dff2c95b8da0e62055cec.webm?t=1749095926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440330/extras/0cc7a27ab87dff2c95b8da